   "note": "Runs east from a sluice head behind Kiln Row along the seam between the furnace districts and the neon ones, then turns south at Crown Reach, drops through the Reach weir and empties into the harbour. Every rectangle here clears all six district plates, their road strips, their building blocks, every POI and every filling station; road bridges are derived from the arterials rather than authored, so moving a road moves its bridge."
